ming a diagonal victory.</reason>\n<answer>X(2,2)</answer>", "episode_score": -2.458, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>Complete the diagonal from (0,0) to (2,2) to win; (2,2) is the only move that creates a winning line with existing X's at (0,1) and (1,1), forming a diagonal victory.</reason>\n<answer>X(2,2)</answer>"}]
